# Cell from playpick: mode=battleground map=conquest spec=warrior:arms
# style=good view=390x844,touch save=fresh.
#
# This is the exact pull direction.md's hypothesis 7 has been asking for since
# 2026-09-28: every `good`-style death on conquest so far has been a caster
# (druid:balance, druid:restoration), both dying at fightTime~9s inside the
# opening scrum, and the open question is whether that is conquest's own
# spawn geometry punishing anyone who closes distance, or just casters being
# squishy while closing. warrior:arms is the first melee-capable spec this
# line has ever put through `good` on any battleground -- a melee kit closes
# distance on purpose and is built to survive doing it, so if it also dies in
# the same ~9s window, the geometry explanation wins; if it does not, kit
# matters after all.
